        375,
        908,
        1160,
        973
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is important that City agencies engaging in the procurement of goods and services for The City of New York coordinate their efforts to achieve greater participation by minority businesses.",
      "logprob_stats": {
